			"notes": "## V1.1.23 - NBT PROCESSOR\n**We designed an NBT processor and provided a processor registration interface so that developers and players can handle special blocks in schematics according to specific situations..**\n\n### How to add my nbt processor to the game?\nUse `LitematicaReader.registerBlockProcessors(BlockNbtProcessable... processors)` to register a nbt processor in your mod.\n\nWe're designing a new system to make sure non-technical players can easily register NBT processors through data packs or other methods. Stay tuned!\n\n### Other changes\n- You can remove a storage bot from a task. Items on the bot will still be kept, but they won't count towards the task items.\n- Move the markers from the name to the lore.\n- Fix bugs..."
