			"notes": "## V1.1.15 - INTERNATIONALIZATION\n**Considering that more people might need this module, we added internationalization in this update.**\n\n### How to switch language\nUse /liteitemlist config language <lang> to switch language.(Operators only)\n\n### Supported language\n- English (US) [en-us]\n- Chinese (Simplified) [zh-cn] More language will be supported in future versions.\n\n### Other changes\n- Operators can reload tasks in-game through command.\n- The \"info\" button will show more details in item list gui.\n- Current task will auto-switch while you are trying to open a task you have joined.\n- Fix bugs..."
